an Bouin"] " quickly pulled away from the field.  For the remainder of the race, until the final straight, Bouin led with Kolehmainen on his heels.  Finally, after repeated attempts to pass Bouin, Kolehmainen pulled ahead only 20 metres from the finish.  The two leaders shattered the previous world record, as nobody had previously broken 15 minutes for the distance."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In September 1914, both Bouin and the bronze medalist, Britain’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/69177"} "George  Hutson"] ", were killed in World War I."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/67641"} "Hannes Kolehmainen"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FIN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FIN.png"}] "FIN"]] [:td {} "15:38.9 (1 h4)"] [:td {} "14:36.6 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "World Record"} "WR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/68086"} "Jean Bouin"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "15:05.0 (1 h5)"] [:td {} "14:36.7 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/69177"} "George Hutson"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "15:29.0 (3 h2)"] [:td {} "15:07.6 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {}